{"id":"86815e73090cf56c","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-grammar-derivation-notation.md","title":"73-df-grammar-derivation-notation — grammar derivation notation","display":"73-df-grammar-derivation-notation — grammar derivation notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-grammar-derivation-notation","display":"73-df-grammar-derivation-notation — grammar derivation notation","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-notation]]","[[73-df-cfg-derivation]]","[[73-df-cfg-leftmost-derivation]]"],"aliases":["73-df-grammar-derivation-notation","73-definition-4.2"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-grammar-derivation-notation"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-grammar-derivation-notation — grammar derivation notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c0217e1a08a868eb\" href=\"?note=c0217e1a08a868eb\" title=\"73-df-cfg-notation\">73-df-cfg-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76137a7886cfb97a\" href=\"?note=76137a7886cfb97a\" title=\"73-df-cfg-derivation\">73-df-cfg-derivation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c57bbf0a680e199a\" href=\"?note=c57bbf0a680e199a\" title=\"73-df-cfg-leftmost-derivation\">73-df-cfg-leftmost-derivation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-grammar-derivation-notation</span><span>73-definition-4.2</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,T,P,S)\\in\\mathrm{CFG}\">\\(G=(V,T,P,S)\\in\\mathrm{CFG}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c0217e1a08a868eb\" href=\"?note=c0217e1a08a868eb\" title=\"73-df-cfg-notation\">73-df-cfg-notation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in(V\\cup T)^*\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in(V\\cup T)^*\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>一步、有限步、最左一步关系分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76137a7886cfb97a\" href=\"?note=76137a7886cfb97a\" title=\"73-df-cfg-derivation\">73-df-cfg-derivation</a> 和 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c57bbf0a680e199a\" href=\"?note=c57bbf0a680e199a\" title=\"73-df-cfg-leftmost-derivation\">73-df-cfg-leftmost-derivation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lm}\">\\(\\mathrm{lm}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{lm}\">\\(\\mathsf{lm}\\)</span> 为同一最左策略标签。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.2}\\vdash\n\\alpha\\Rightarrow_G\\beta\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists(A,\\gamma)\\in P\\;\\exists u,v\\in(V\\cup T)^*\\;(\\alpha=uAv\\land\\beta=u\\gamma v)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.2}\\vdash\n\\alpha\\Rightarrow_G\\beta\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists(A,\\gamma)\\in P\\;\\exists u,v\\in(V\\cup T)^*\\;(\\alpha=uAv\\land\\beta=u\\gamma v)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.2}\\vdash\n\\alpha\\Rightarrow_G^*\\beta\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\to(V\\cup T)^*\\;\n(\\rho(0)=\\alpha\\land\\rho(n)=\\beta\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\rho(i)\\Rightarrow_G\\rho(i+1))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.2}\\vdash\n\\alpha\\Rightarrow_G^*\\beta\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\to(V\\cup T)^*\\;\n(\\rho(0)=\\alpha\\land\\rho(n)=\\beta\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\rho(i)\\Rightarrow_G\\rho(i+1))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.2}\\vdash\n\\alpha\\Rightarrow_{G,\\mathrm{lm}}\\beta\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists(A,\\gamma)\\in P\\;\\exists u\\in T^*\\;\\exists v\\in(V\\cup T)^*\\;\n(\\alpha=uAv\\land\\beta=u\\gamma v)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.2}\\vdash\n\\alpha\\Rightarrow_{G,\\mathrm{lm}}\\beta\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists(A,\\gamma)\\in P\\;\\exists u\\in T^*\\;\\exists v\\in(V\\cup T)^*\\;\n(\\alpha=uAv\\land\\beta=u\\gamma v)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目保留原调用记号；参数与类型由 Hypothesis 固定，Assertion 给出完整定义或结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-notation","status":"resolved","id":"c0217e1a08a868eb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"76137a7886cfb97a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-derivation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-leftmost-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"c57bbf0a680e199a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-leftmost-derivation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-notation","status":"resolved","id":"c0217e1a08a868eb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $G=(V,T,P,S)\\in\\mathrm{CFG}$，见 [[73-df-cfg-notation]]；$\\alpha,\\beta\\in(V\\cup T)^*$。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"76137a7886cfb97a","anchor":